  "id": "fresh-cherry-ice-cream",
  "name": "Fresh Cherry Ice Cream",
  "subtitle": "Creamy churned ice cream with ripe cherries",
  "description": "A simple American-style ice cream combining a sweet cream base, vanilla, almond extract, and fresh cherries.",
